{"id":"nettoyage","lemma":"nettoyage","pos":"noun","rank":3206,"glosses":["cleaning"],"ipa":"/nɛ.twa.jaʒ/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"nettoyages"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/69/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Sartus85-nettoyage.wav","formAudio":{"nettoyages":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e2/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-nettoyages.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Nous avons terminé le nettoyage de la salle de classe.","en":"We've finished cleaning the classroom.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/653633","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to end","l":"terminer"},{"g":"the / it"},null,null,null,null,null,null],"phrases":[[5,7,"of the"],[7,10,"classroom"]]},{"text":"Ma femme est obsédée par le nettoyage.","en":"My wife is obsessed with cleaning.","words":[{"g":"my","l":"mon"},{"g":"woman"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"obsessed","l":"obsédé"},{"g":"through"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Elle était prête à l'aider au nettoyage de la maison.","en":"She was ready to help him with cleaning the house.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"ready","l":"prêt"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"to help"},{"g":"to the"},null,null,null,{"g":"house, home"}],"phrases":[[8,10,"of the"]]},{"text":"Comme vous pouvez voir, je n'ai pas procédé au nettoyage de la maison depuis un certain temps.","en":"As you can see, I haven't done any cleaning in the house for some time.","words":[{"g":"as"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"to see"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"procedure"},{"g":"to the"},null,null,null,{"g":"house, home"},{"g":"since"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"certain, guaranteed"},{"g":"time"}],"phrases":[[11,13,"of the"]]}]}